@startuml
title Sequence Diagram 4: Organizer Checks In an Attendee (F4)
autonumber
actor "Organizer" as P0
participant "React UI" as P1
participant "Check-in API" as P2
participant "Check-in Service" as P3
participant "Database" as P4
participant "Audit Logger" as P5
P0 -> P1 : Enter or scan ticket ID
P1 -> P2 : POST /api/events/:id/checkins
P2 -> P3 : checkIn(eventId, ticketId, organizerId)
P3 -> P3 : Verify organizer owns the event
P3 -> P4 : Find registration by ticket ID
P4 --> P3 : Registration or none
alt valid ticket, CONFIRMED, not used, same event
P3 -> P4 : Set CHECKED_IN and timestamp
P3 -> P5 : Log CHECKIN
P2 --> P1 : 200 {attendeeName, checkedInAt}
P1 --> P0 : Show success
else invalid, other event, cancelled, waitlisted or used
P2 --> P1 : 404 or 409 with specific message
P1 --> P0 : Show error
end
@enduml
